      ],
      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": true,
      "data": {
        "markdown": "# Concrete Use Cases\n\nTwilite is not limited to one category of thinking.\n\nExamples:\n\n- software architecture graphs\n- AI workspace graphs\n- worldbuilding graphs\n- investigative research graphs\n- knowledge gardens\n- documentation systems\n- game design graphs\n- semantic memory systems\n- project planning graphs\n- product ecosystem maps\n\nThe same runtime can support:\n\n- thinking\n- collaboration\n- publishing\n- execution\n- navigation\n\nwithout changing mediums.",
        "memo": "",
        "link": "",
        "html": "",
        "svg": "",
        "visibilityRole": "browser",
        "_placement": {
          "version": 1,
          "state": "manually-shaped",
          "source": "manual",
          "updatedAt": 1778699635763,
          "reason": "node-drag"
        }
      }
    },
