      ],
      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": true,
      "data": {
        "markdown": "# Twilite vs Traditional Tools\n\nTwilite overlaps with many categories without fully matching any of them.\n\nNot merely:\n\n- a whiteboard\n- a note-taking app\n- a workflow graph\n- a chat interface\n- a documentation tool\n- a mind map\n- or a visual scripting system\n\nThe difference:\n\nTwilite treats the graph itself as the durable semantic artifact.\n\nThe graph is:\n\n- addressable\n- explorable\n- AI-readable\n- AI-editable\n- publishable\n- portable\n- structurally meaningful",
        "memo": "",
        "link": "",
        "html": "",
        "svg": "",
        "visibilityRole": "browser",
        "_placement": {
          "version": 1,
          "state": "manually-shaped",
          "source": "manual",
          "updatedAt": 1778699861403,
          "reason": "node-drag"
        }
      }
    },
