      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": true,
      "data": {
        "markdown": "# AI Collaboration\n\nTwilite is designed for humans and AI to work against the same persistent structure.\n\nInstead of generating isolated text blobs, AI can:\n\n- navigate graph structure\n- inspect semantic relationships\n- update nodes\n- create connections\n- maintain continuity\n- preserve references\n- operate through mutation contracts\n\nThis allows AI collaboration to become:\n\n- durable\n- inspectable\n- reversible\n- structured\n- graph-native\n\nThe graph becomes shared cognitive terrain.",
        "memo": "",
        "link": "",
        "html": "",
        "svg": "",
        "visibilityRole": "browser",
        "_placement": {
          "version": 1,
          "state": "auto-placed",
          "source": "layout",
          "updatedAt": 1778698422220,
          "reason": "auto-layout"
        }
      }
    },
