      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": true,
      "data": {
        "markdown": "# Semantic Zoom\n\nTwilite supports layered understanding.\n\nFrom far away:\n\n- high-level concepts\n- product identity\n- major structures\n\nCloser:\n\n- implementation details\n- supporting evidence\n- semantic relationships\n- runtime behavior\n\nThe graph changes density as understanding deepens.\n\nThis allows a single graph to support:\n\n- onboarding\n- exploration\n- authoring\n- advanced architecture",
        "memo": "",
        "link": "",
        "html": "",
        "svg": "",
        "visibilityRole": "browser",
        "_placement": {
          "version": 1,
