      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": true,
      "data": {
        "markdown": "# Why Graphs Matter\n\nMost systems hide relationships.\n\nTwilite exposes them directly.\n\nIdeas are not isolated.\nThey exist in relation to:\n\n- causes\n- dependencies\n- references\n- abstractions\n- examples\n- systems\n- workflows\n- people\n\nA graph preserves those relationships instead of flattening them into linear documents.",
        "memo": "",
        "link": "",
        "html": "",
        "svg": "",
        "visibilityRole": "browser",
